      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "There is no way to put a completely transparent background, in iOS such an opportunity is present.\r\nThe problem is in **nav_bar.dart line 122**\r\n```\r\n if (backgroundColor.alpha == 0xFF)\r\n```\r\nFull description of the problem:\r\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/55240765/fully-transparent-cupertinonavigationbar-possible\r\n\r\nIt might be worth adding a flag like **fullyTransparent** and do something like that:\r\n```\r\n if (backgroundColor.alpha == 0xFF || fullyTransparent)\r\n```\r\nor move this validation in public widget function that it can be override later",
